### EFAR API - Dashboard Endpoints (Liang Yi / Jasper implementation)
### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).
###
### Prerequisites:
### 1. Backend running locally: cd backend && node src/index.js  (default PORT=3000)
### 2. Demo users seeded: node src/scripts/seed-users.js
###    (all demo accounts share the password "Efar@2026")
###
### The login request below is run once; its response token is captured into
### @mdToken and reused automatically by every subsequent request in this file
### via {{login.response.body.$.data.token}} - no need to copy/paste tokens manually.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================================
### AUTH - obtain a Managing Director token
### Both dashboard endpoints are restricted to the managing_director role,
### so every request below needs this token in its Authorization header.
### ============================================================

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "doris@efar.com.sg",
  "password": "Efar@2026"
}

###

@mdToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}


### ============================================================
### GET /api/dashboard/fleet-overview  (UC-06)
### ============================================================

### Happy path: valid managing_director token, valid "this_week" period
### Expect: 200 OK with totals, booking_status_breakdown, and revenue_risk
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/fleet-overview?period=this_week
Authorization: Bearer {{mdToken}}

###

### Invalid input: "period" is not one of today/this_week/this_month
### Expect: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR ("period must be one of: today, this_week, this_month")
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/fleet-overview?period=last_year
Authorization: Bearer {{mdToken}}

###

### No auth: Authorization header omitted entirely
### Expect: 401 UNAUTHORIZED ("Missing or invalid token.")
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/fleet-overview?period=today


### ============================================================
### GET /api/dashboard/vendor-expenses  (UC-07)
### ============================================================

### Happy path: valid managing_director token, valid date range
### Expect: 200 OK with summary, by_vendor (sorted by expenditure desc), monthly_trend
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/vendor-expenses?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-06-30
Authorization: Bearer {{mdToken}}

###

### Invalid input: date_from is after date_to
### Expect: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR on field "date_to" ("date_from must be before or equal to date_to.")
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/vendor-expenses?date_from=2026-06-30&date_to=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{mdToken}}

###

### No auth: Authorization header omitted entirely
### Expect: 401 UNAUTHORIZED ("Missing or invalid token.")
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/vendor-expenses?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-06-30
